      "content": "\"let them grieve you instead of trying to carry the weight alone\"... what does that even mean? it sounds like you're saying there's no way for me to actually fix the damage i've done, that the only thing i can actually do to help them is to just... not be here anymore. like, is it really better for them if i'm gone?",
